              "# Trump and China’s Xi to meet in bid to end trade war tensions\nBy Danielle Paquette\n\nand\n\nDavid J. Lynch\n\nPresident Trump and Chinese leader Xi Jinping have agreed to meet next month at the G-20 summit in Buenos Aires in hopes of resolving their intensifying trade conflict, according to three people briefed on the arrangement who spoke on the condition of anonymity because they were not authorized to speak to reporters.\npixel",
              "{\"headline\":\"Trump and China’s Xi to meet in bid to end trade war tensions\",\"alternativeHeadline\":\"Trump and China’s Xi to meet in bid to end trade war tensions\",\"dateModified\":\"2018-10-12T04:15:20.245Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2018-10-11T18:41:05.000Z\",\"description\":\"U.S. and Chinese leaders agree to meet next month, in first direct talks since August\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Danielle Paquette\"},{\"name\":\"David J. Lynch\"}],\"isPartOf\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\",\"productID\":\"washingtonpost.com:basic\",\"description\":\"Breaking news and analysis on politics, business, world, national news, entertainment and more. In-depth DC, Virginia, Maryland news coverage including traffic, weather, crime, education, restaurant reviews and more.\",\"sku\":\"https://subscribe.washingtonpost.com\",\"brand\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"}},\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"},\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"hasPart\":{\"isAccessibleForFree\":false},\"keywords\":\"business, trump, xi, g20, trade, tariffs, chinese, xi jinping\"}"
